OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy in the east with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, while western areas
OL,7,Fstart dry with sunny spells. Rain
OL,8,Fdrifts west then retreats east later.
OL,9,FFurther rain, heavy in places, spreads
OL,10,Ffrom the west. Winds strengthen later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FBands of rain move east-
OL,13,Fnortheastwards with a clear spells in
OL,14,Fbetween. Heavy showers follow into the
OL,15,Fsouthwest, where it becomes windy with
OL,16,Fcoastal gales developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
