OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FRain continues to push
OL,6,Facross Scotland, turning heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes. Elsewhere, showers and squally
OL,8,Frain move east, heavy and possibly
OL,9,Fthundery near southern and
OL,10,Fsouthwestern coasts. Windy across the
OL,11,Fsouth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
